  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CVU Highway Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Vial CVU</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">La postergacin de las inversiones sobre la red vial del pas en los ltimos aos ha tenido un impacto directo sobre el estado de la red y las condiciones del transporte, tanto de pasajeros como de carga. En ese sentido y considerando la relevancia del modo vial en la matriz econmico-social del pas, el Programa busca reactivar las inversiones sobre la red vial nacional, particularmente, sobre los tramos bajo concesin de la CVU. Especficamente, el Programa contribuir a disminuir los costos de transporte de la red vial administrada por la CVU mediante la financiacin de obras de rehabilitacin y mantenimiento vial.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The postponement of the investments in roads during the past years have greatly impacted the general condition of the net and the transportation system for both cargo and passengers. In this matter and considering the importance of transportation for the social and economical development of the country, the Program looks to reactivate the investments in the road net, especially in the segments under concession by the CVU. The Program will contribute to decrease the transport cost in the road net administered by the CVU through the financing of rehabilitation and maintenance works.</narrative>
  </description>
